  "strings": [
    "The lighthouse hums.",
    "Fog rolls off the water. Marlow's lantern swings a slow arc across the pier.",
    "Harbor's closed after the ninth bell. State your business.",
    "Show the courier's writ.",
    "Slip toward the warehouses without a word.",
    "Stacked crates make a canyon of the row. Somewhere ahead, a door stands ajar.",
    "The crates again. The ajar door has not moved.",
    "Hold it. I know that walk — you were told to stay off the row.",
    "Warehouse Nine, end of the row. Don't make me regret the writ.",
    "Step through the ajar door.",
    "Double back to the pier.",
    "One pull and every guard on the quay comes running. Walk back the way you came."
  ],
